---
layout: layouts/base.liquid
title: "911 Cancer Lawsuit | Free WTC Disaster Area Case Review"
description: "If you lived, worked, or served in the New York City disaster area after September 11, 2001 and have since been diagnosed with cancer, you may have legal rights. Free case review. No obligation."
pageUrl: "https://911cancerlawsuit.com/"
canonicalUrl: "https://911cancerlawsuit.com/"
permalink: "/index.html"
bodyClass: "is-home"
pageSchema: |
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "911 Cancer Lawsuit",
    "url": "https://911cancerlawsuit.com/",
    "description": "Free case review for people diagnosed with cancer after exposure in the NYC disaster area following September 11, 2001.",
    "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "url": "https://911cancerlawsuit.com/" }
  }
  </script>
---

{% comment %} ── Hero ── {% endcomment %}
<section class="hero" id="hero-container">
  <div class="hero_bg">
    <picture>
      <source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="/images/home/hero-bg-lg.webp" type="image/webp">
      <source media="(min-width: 640px)"  srcset="/images/home/hero-bg-md.webp" type="image/webp">
      <img class="hero_image" src="/images/home/hero-bg-m.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" fetchpriority="high"
           width="640" height="900"
           onerror="this.parentElement.style.background='linear-gradient(135deg,#0B1D3A 0%,#2D1B69 100%)'">
    </picture>
    <div class="hero_overlay"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container hero_inner">
    <div class="hero_copy">
      <h1 class="hero_title">You Were There.<br><span class="hero_title_accent">Your Health Matters.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero_subtitle">If you lived, worked, volunteered, or participated in rescue, recovery, or cleanup efforts in the New York City disaster area after September 11, 2001, and have since been diagnosed with certain cancers, you may have legal rights. A free case review can help determine whether you may qualify to pursue compensation related to your diagnosis. There is no obligation to learn more.</p>
      <ul class="hero_trust">
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
          Free Case Review
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
          No Upfront Costs
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
          No Obligation
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a href="#eligibility" class="button button--lg button--gold hero_cta">
        See If You Qualify. It's Free.
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-8.707l-3-3a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414L10.586 9H7a1 1 0 100 2h3.586l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414l3-3a1 1 0 000-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    {% comment %}
      Live campaign form (campaignCode: WTCWEBLEADS) — lives directly in the hero
      instead of an image, so it's visible without scrolling on desktop.
    {% endcomment %}
    <div class="hero_media elig-card" id="eligibility">
      <p class="elig-card-title">Request Your Free Case Review</p>
      <div class="elig-step-indicator" id="ll-progress" role="progressbar" aria-valuenow="1" aria-valuemax="5">
        <div class="elig-step-dot active"></div>
        <div class="elig-step-dot"></div>
        <div class="elig-step-dot"></div>
        <div class="elig-step-dot"></div>
        <div class="elig-step-dot"></div>
      </div>
      <script src="/form.min.js"></script>
      <div id="ll-form"></div>

      <div class="elig-trust-badges">
        <span>Free Consultation</span>
        <span>Confidential Review</span>
        <span>No Obligation</span>
      </div>
      <p class="elig-fallback">Call Now or Complete the Form Above &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <a href="tel:+1{{ site.defaultPhone }}" data-dynamic-phone-tel><span data-dynamic-phone>{{ site.defaultPhoneFormatted }}</span></a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% comment %} ── Who May Qualify ── {% endcomment %}
<section class="section section--padded">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="awareness-grid">

      {% comment %} IMAGE SLOT 2 — Recommended: a quiet, respectful image (memorial, skyline, or documents/consultation). {% endcomment %}
      <div class="awareness_media reveal">
        <picture>
          <source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="/images/home/awareness-lg.webp" type="image/webp">
          <source media="(min-width: 640px)"  srcset="/images/home/awareness-md.webp" type="image/webp">
          <img src="/images/home/awareness-m.webp"
               alt="Lower Manhattan"
               loading="lazy"
               width="600" height="480"
               onerror="this.closest('.awareness_media').classList.add('awareness_media--placeholder')">
        </picture>
      </div>

      <div class="awareness_copy reveal">
        <h2>Your exposure happened years ago. The effects may only be appearing now.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Many individuals who were exposed to toxic dust and debris developed serious health conditions years later. You may be eligible for a free case review if you:</p>
        <div class="awareness_points">
          <div class="awareness_point">
            <div class="awareness_point_icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Worked, Lived, or Attended School in the Area</strong>
              <p>Worked, lived, attended school, or volunteered in the affected area after September 11, 2001.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="awareness_point">
            <div class="awareness_point_icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Took Part in Rescue, Recovery, or Cleanup</strong>
              <p>Participated in rescue, recovery, cleanup, or related operations in the disaster area.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="awareness_point">
            <div class="awareness_point_icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Diagnosed With Cancer or a Qualifying Illness</strong>
              <p>Were later diagnosed with certain types of cancer or another qualifying illness.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% comment %} ── Why Contact Us ── {% endcomment %}
<section class="section section--padded">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="how-it-works-grid">
      <div class="how-it-works_copy">
        <div class="section_header reveal" style="text-align:left; margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <h2 class="section_heading">Why Contact Us?</h2>
          <p class="section_lead" style="margin:0; text-align:left;">Our team helps individuals determine whether they may qualify for a World Trade Center-related cancer claim. We'll review your circumstances, answer your questions, and explain the next steps. All at no cost and with no obligation.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="steps steps--vertical reveal">
          <li class="step step--horizontal">
            <div class="step_icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="step_number">Step 01</div>
              <h3 class="step_title">Complete the Short Form or Call</h3>
              <p>Tell us a few basic things about your time in the disaster area and your diagnosis. It takes about a minute and costs nothing.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="step step--horizontal">
            <div class="step_icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="step_number">Step 02</div>
              <h3 class="step_title">We Review Your Circumstances</h3>
              <p>A member of our team reviews your information and reaches out to answer your questions and explain next steps.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="step step--horizontal">
            <div class="step_icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="step_number">Step 03</div>
              <h3 class="step_title">Understand Your Options</h3>
              <p>If you may qualify, we explain what a claim could involve. <strong>There is no cost and no obligation to move forward.</strong></p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      {% comment %} IMAGE SLOT 3 — Recommended: consultation, phone call, or advocate meeting with someone. {% endcomment %}
      <div class="how-it-works_media reveal">
        <picture>
          <source media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="/images/home/consultation-lg.webp" type="image/webp">
          <source media="(min-width: 640px)"  srcset="/images/home/consultation-md.webp" type="image/webp">
          <img src="/images/home/consultation-m.webp"
               alt="Team member on a phone consultation"
               loading="lazy"
               width="560" height="600"
               onerror="this.closest('.how-it-works_media').classList.add('img-slot--placeholder')">
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% comment %} ── "Your story deserves to be heard" banner ── {% endcomment %}
<section class="section section--padded section--alt">
  <div class="container">

    {% comment %} IMAGE SLOT 4 — Recommended: a warm, respectful image of someone being listened to / a supportive conversation. {% endcomment %}
    <div class="treatment-banner reveal">
      <img src="/images/home/treatment.jpg"
           alt="A supportive conversation"
           loading="lazy"
           width="1200" height="380"
           onerror="this.parentElement.classList.add('treatment-banner--placeholder')">
      <div class="treatment-banner_overlay">
        <h2 class="treatment-banner_heading">Your story deserves to be heard.</h2>
        <p class="treatment-banner_sub">We're here to listen. Share only what you're comfortable with. A free case review starts with a simple conversation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="treatment-cta reveal">
      <p>If you were exposed in the NYC disaster area and have since been diagnosed with cancer, you may be owed compensation.</p>
      <a href="#eligibility" class="button button--lg">See If You Qualify</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% comment %} ── FAQ ── {% endcomment %}
<section class="section section--padded">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section_header reveal">
      <h2 class="section_heading section_heading--center">Common Questions</h2>
      <p class="section_lead">Plain answers to the questions we hear most often.</p>
    </div>
    <div id="faq-app" class="reveal" data-faqs="{{ faqs | json | escape }}"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {% for faq in faqs %}{
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {{ faq.question | json }},
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": {{ faq.answer | json }}
      }
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

{% comment %} ── Final CTA ── {% endcomment %}
<section class="section section--padded section--cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-block reveal">
      <h2>Free Case Review. No Upfront Costs. No Obligation.</h2>
      <p>There is no obligation to learn more. A free case review takes just a few minutes and costs you nothing.</p>
      <div class="cta-block_actions">
        <a href="#eligibility" class="button button--lg button--gold">Request Your Free Case Review</a>
        <a href="tel:+1{{ site.defaultPhone }}" class="button button--lg button--outline" data-dynamic-phone-tel>
          Call <span data-dynamic-phone>{{ site.defaultPhoneFormatted }}</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="cta-block_legal">Free Consultation &nbsp;·&nbsp; Confidential Review &nbsp;·&nbsp; No Obligation</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
